# [[.DisplayName]] — Agent Guide

## Project

**[[.DisplayName]]** admin console. Vite 6 + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind 3.

Backend API: `[[.APIURL]]` (override via `VITE_API_URL`).

## Before making changes

1. Read `.cursor/rules/karpathy.mdc` — think first, simplify, surgical changes.
2. Read `.cursor/rules/architecture.mdc` — feature structure, API patterns.
3. Read `.cursor/rules/tailwind.mdc` — Tailwind only, no extra UI kits.

## Adding a feature

Follow `.cursor/skills/add-feature/SKILL.md` step-by-step.
Always run `npm run build` to verify before finishing.

## Key conventions

- API calls go through `src/api/client.ts` (axios, auto-unwraps `{data}` envelope).
- Auth state in `useAuthStore` (Zustand persist). Never store in component state.
- Protected routes use `<ProtectedRoute />` — redirect to `/login` if no token.
- Pages (`src/pages/`) are thin wrappers; logic lives in `src/features/`.
- Tailwind utility classes only. No custom CSS beyond `src/index.css` directives.

## Verification

```bash
npm run build   # must pass before any PR
npm run dev     # local dev on http://localhost:5173
```
